# Inlining a used module in explain

> Using Explain_rate

```catala
declaration scope Compute:
  input x content decimal
  output y content decimal

scope Compute:
  definition y equals x * Explain_rate.rate

#[test]
declaration scope Test:
  output result content Compute

scope Test:
  definition result equals output of Compute with { -- x: 2.0 }
```
